	Applied: "{0} is now used in the game"
	TipPublish: Share on the Studio Workshop
	TipExport: Export in the game's own format: frames stacked vertically, one file per animation frame, plus a tModLoader body sheet and a glowmask when they apply. Opens the folder
	TipImport: Import a .png sprite / sheet into a new layer, or open a .vsd design
	TipFromEquipped: Copy the sprite of the armor or accessory you're showing in this slot into a new layer, so you can repaint it
	TipRecopy: Copy the current sprite into a new layer again (resource packs included)
	TipSave: Save now (Ctrl+S)
	TipLibrary: All your designs
	TipWorkshop: Studio Workshop: what other players made
