	TipMirror: Mirror horizontally (M)
	TipGrid: Pixel grid
	TipReference: Show the character (or the original sprite) under the canvas ({0}%, scroll to change)
	HintPencil: LMB: main color, RMB: back color, Alt: pick color.
	HintEraser: Click and drag to erase.
	HintFill: Click to fill an area. Shift+click: replace that color everywhere.
	HintPicker: LMB / RMB: take the color for the main / back slot.
	HintLine: Drag to draw a straight line.
	HintRect: Drag for a rectangle. Hold Shift to fill it.
	HintMove: Drag to shift the whole drawing.
	HintNav: Wheel: zoom · Middle mouse / Space+drag: pan · F: fit · Tab: next pose
	PoseBase: All poses
	TipPoseBase: Draw once and it's used for every pose. The little walking bounce is added for you
	PoseStand: Stand
	PoseJump: Jump
	PoseUse: Swing {0}
	PoseWalk: Walk {0}
	GroupStand: Stand
	GroupUse: Swing
	GroupJump: Jump / fly
	GroupWalk: Walk
	TipGroupStand: Standing still. Usually the same as "All poses"
	TipGroupUse: The 4 frames of swinging or using an item: arms move here
	TipGroupJump: In the air: jumping, falling and flying
	TipGroupWalk: The 14 frames of the walk cycle: legs and arms move a lot
	TipPoseOverride: Has its own drawing. Right-click to go back to the base drawing
	TipPoseInherit: Uses the base drawing. Draw here to give this pose its own version
	PoseOwn: has its own drawing
	PoseInherits: uses the base drawing, draw to change only this pose
	TipPoseNext: Next pose (Tab)
	TipPosePrev: Previous pose (Shift+Tab)
	TipPoseFromPrev: Start from the drawing of {0}: the fastest way through a walk cycle
	TipPoseFillGroup: Copy this pose to every {0} pose
	TipPoseClearGroup: Clear every {0} pose back to the base drawing
	PoseFilled: Copied to the whole group
	HintAllPoses: One drawing for every pose. Pick a group above only when something must look different there (sleeves while swinging, legs while walking).
	HintLegsWalk: Legs change shape while walking: the walk preview will look stiff until the Walk frames are drawn.
	StartWalk: Draw the walk frames
	UsingBase: showing base
	SheetFrames: Sprite sheet: {0} frames
	SheetFrameN: Frame {0}
	HintSheet: each frame of the game's sprite sheet, top to bottom
	TipSheetFill: Copy this frame to every frame
