	TipLayerDuplicate: Duplicate layer
	TipLayerDelete: Delete layer
	TipLayerUp: Move layer up
	TipLayerDown: Move layer down
	TipLayerMerge: Merge into the layer below
	TipLayerFlip: Flip what's on screen horizontally. Shift: whole layer
	TipLayerOutline: Add a 1px outline in the main color around the drawing. Shift: whole layer
	TipEffects: Effects: glow, dye shader, particles
