	TipRename: Double-click to rename
	TipFrameAdd: New empty frame
	TipFrameDuplicate: Duplicate frame
	TipFrameDelete: Delete frame
	TipFrameLeft: Move frame left
	TipFrameRight: Move frame right
	TipPlay: Play / pause (Enter)
	TipOnion: Onion skin (O)
	TipDuration: Frame duration. Scroll or click, Shift for bigger steps
