	FramesN: "{0} frames"
	TipCelClear: Right-click to clear (only the selected pose)
	EffectsTitle: Effects: {0}
	FxGlow: Glow
	FxPulse: Pulse
	TipFxGlow: These pixels ignore lighting, like a glowmask: bright even in a dark cave
	TipFxPulse: Glow that slowly breathes in and out
