	TutDontShow: Don't show this again
	TutNext: Next
	TutBack: Back
	TutSkip: Skip
	TutFinish: Let's go!
	TutWelcomeTitle: Welcome to Vanity Studio!
	TutWelcome:
		'''
		Here you can draw your own hats, shirts, trousers, capes and wings, repaint armor you already own, or give any item, NPC, boss or projectile a new look.
		This quick tour shows where everything is. It takes under a minute, and you can reopen it later with the ? button.
		'''
	TutSetupTitle: Name, slot and look
	TutSetup:
		'''
		Name the design and pick where it's worn with the pictures: head, body, legs, front (scarves, belts) or back (capes, wings).
		"Hide original" hides whatever you're wearing in that slot, so your design takes its place. Stats never change.
		'''
	TutToolsTitle: Tools
	TutTools:
		'''
		Pencil, eraser, fill, color picker, line, rectangle and move. Under them: brush size, mirror drawing, the pixel grid, and your character shown under the canvas.
		Every tool has a keyboard shortcut, hover a button to see it.
		'''
	TutCanvasTitle: Canvas
	TutCanvas:
		'''
		This is the same frame the game uses, so what you draw sits exactly where it will on your character. The faded character underneath helps you line things up.
		Left click paints with the main color, right click with the back color. Scroll to zoom, hold the middle mouse button to move around.
		'''
	TutPosesTitle: Poses
	TutPoses:
		'''
		Most of the time you just draw in "All poses": it's used everywhere, and the walking bounce is added for you.
		When something has to look different, pick a group: Swing for arms, Walk for legs. Step through its frames with the arrows or Tab, start each one from the previous pose with one click, and watch the preview follow along. A gold dot marks poses with their own drawing.
		'''
	TutTimelineTitle: Layers, effects and frames
	TutTimeline:
		'''
		On the left are your layers: add, reorder, merge, hide them and change their opacity. The wand on a layer opens its effects: glowing pixels, pulsing, any dye's shader and particles.
		On the right is the timeline: add frames to animate the design and set how long each one lasts.
		'''
	TutPreviewTitle: Live preview
	TutPreview: Your character wearing the design as you draw. Auto runs through every action, or pick one. The moon switches to night so you can see what glows. Scroll over it to zoom.
	TutColorsTitle: Colors
	TutColors: The big square is the main color, the one behind it is the back color, click them to swap. Use the sliders, type a hex code, or pick from the palette, your character's own colors and recently used ones.
	TutActionsTitle: Saving, sharing, importing
	TutActions:
		'''
		Undo/redo, your designs, the Studio Workshop with everyone's creations, save, copy what you're wearing into a layer, import, export in the game's own format, and publish to the Workshop.
		You don't have to press save: everything is saved automatically for every character, world and server.
		'''
	TutWearTitle: Wear it
	TutWear:
		'''
		Press this to put the design on (or, for an item or NPC, to use your sprite in the game). It stays between sessions, and players on the same server see your clothes too, even while you're still drawing.
		Have fun!
		'''
}
